---
interface Props {
  extraBottomPadding?: boolean;
}

const { extraBottomPadding = false } = Astro.props;
const currentYear = 2027;
---

<footer class={`bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 text-slate-400 text-sm mt-20 ${extraBottomPadding ? 'pb-16' : ''}`}>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Slogan -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center p-1 text-white">
            <svg class="w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
              <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="8" fill="currentColor"/>
              <circle cx="16" cy="20" r="4.5" fill="#bae6fd"/>
              <circle cx="48" cy="20" r="4.5" fill="#bae6fd"/>
              <circle cx="16" cy="44" r="4.5" fill="#bae6fd"/>
              <circle cx="48" cy="44" r="4.5" fill="#bae6fd"/>
              <line x1="32" y1="32" x2="16" y2="20" stroke="#bae6fd" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="32" y1="32" x2="48" y2="20" stroke="#bae6fd" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="32" y1="32" x2="16" y2="44" stroke="#bae6fd" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="32" y1="32" x2="48" y2="44" stroke="#bae6fd" stroke-width="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">2027节点推荐</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-900/60 text-sky-300 font-mono">jiediantuijian.blog</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          专注提供 2027 年最新高质量科学上网节点推荐与真实测速评测。汇集全专线 IEPL/IPLC 机场、4K/8K 极速流媒体解锁、ChatGPT/Claude 原生支持与高性价比平民节点，助力全球数字化探索与科研外贸办公。
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 rounded"># 2027节点推荐</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 rounded"># 机场节点测速</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 rounded"># IEPL专线</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 rounded"># Clash订阅</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: 核心推荐导航 -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider">节点分类导航</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/nodes?category=flagship" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">2027全专线旗舰节点</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nodes?category=iplc" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">IPLC/IEPL物理专线</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nodes?category=budget" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">平民高性价比节点</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nodes?category=ai-business" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">外贸/AI专属纯净IP</a></li>
          <li><a href="/nodes?category=gaming" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">外服低延迟电竞节点</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: 评测、教程与博客 -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider">专栏、教程与横评</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">2027深度技术与测速专栏</a></li>
          <li><a href="/comparison" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">2027全网节点多维横评 (35家)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/clash-guide" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">Clash Verge Rev / 小火箭教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/android-tv" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">安卓手机 / 电视 / 软路由教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">24篇高频问答深度知识库</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: 站点信息与索引 -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider">站点与索引</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">关于本站评测原则</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">网站地图 (HTML Sitemap)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap.xml" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors" target="_blank">标准 XML 地图 (sitemap.xml)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors" target="_blank">XML 分片索引 (sitemap-index)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about#disclaimer" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">合规与免责声明</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright & Disclaimer -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <div>
        <p>© {currentYear} jiediantuijian.blog (2027节点推荐评测博客). 保留所有权利。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center md:text-right max-w-xl text-[11px] text-slate-500">
        <p>免责声明：本博客所有内容仅用于计算机网络技术探讨、学术交流与流媒体兼容性测试。请读者严格遵守当地法律法规，切勿用于任何非法用途。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
